<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN AMRO finalises Standard Federal buy.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO finalises Standard Federal buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch bank ABN AMRO NV said on Thursday it had finalised the $1.9 billion takeover of Michigan-based Standard Federal Bank Inc.</p>
<p>Standard Federal shareholders approved the $59 per share acquisition on April 17.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
